title: Next and previous tab walk through the tabs and the canvas, which counts as one more place of the cycle
folders: rust-small
limit: 50
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring
expect-log: tabs: \[.*main\.rs, .*util\.rs\], in front: Some\(1\)
expect-log: tabs: \[.*main\.rs, .*util\.rs\], in front: None
expect-log: tabs: \[.*main\.rs, .*util\.rs\], in front: Some\(0\)

wait 3000
tab open src/main.rs
wait 600
tab open src/util.rs
wait 800
tab report
tab canvas
wait 800
mark canvas-in-front
wait 450
tab report
tab next
wait 800
mark next-is-first-tab
wait 450
tab report
tab next
wait 600
tab next
wait 800
mark next-three-times
wait 450
tab report
tab previous
wait 600
tab previous
wait 800
mark previous-twice
wait 450
tab report
quit
